// Package storage keeps the files of the model's file and image fields, in
// the store STORAGE_URL names (a folder, S3 and what speaks it{{if has .Options.drivers "gcs"}}, Google
// Cloud Storage{{end}}{{if has .Options.drivers "azure"}}, Azure Blob Storage{{end}}). A file is asked for (Request), sent straight to
// the store by a signed link, then used by a record (Sync, in the record's
// transaction) once checked: its size, and its real format. Files are read
// by signed links that expire (URL); one no record uses any more leaves the
// store (Clean).
//
